// Note: For WinDbgX debugging, use extension commands (Ctrl+Shift+P):
// - "WinDbgX: Launch" - Start debugging with WinDbgX
// - "WinDbgX: Attach" - Attach to running process
// - "WinDbgX: Record with Time Travel Debugging" - TTD recording
